{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":11,"ref":"job 42:11","book":"job","lang":"su","chapter":42,"translation":"Sarta datang ka anjeunna sadaya sadulur-lalakina, sadaya sadulur awéwéna, jeung sadaya nu mikawawuh manéhna ti baheula; maranehna ngadahar roti jeung anjeunna di imahna, sarta ngageterkeun sirah ka anjeunna, sarta ngahibur ⟨את⟩ anjeunna ngeunaan sadaya kagoréan nu ditimbulkeun Yahwe ka anjeunna; sarta unggal jalma méré ka anjeunna hiji késita (keurakan pérak), jeung unggal jalma hiji anting irung tina emas.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויבאו","gloss":"datang"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"ka anjeunna"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"sadaya"},{"surface":"אחיו","gloss":"sadulur-lalakina"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"sarta sadaya"},{"surface":"אחיתיו","gloss":"sadulur awéwéna"},{"surface":"וכל","gloss":"sarta sadaya"},{"surface":"ידעיו","gloss":"nu mikawawuhana"},{"surface":"לפנים","gloss":"ti baheula"},{"surface":"ויאכלו","gloss":"ngadahar"},{"surface":"עמו","gloss":"jeung anjeunna"},{"surface":"לחם","gloss":"roti"},{"surface":"בביתו","gloss":"di imahna"},{"surface":"וינדו","gloss":"ngageterkeun sirah"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"ka anjeunna"},{"surface":"וינחמו","gloss":"ngahibur"},{"surface":"אתו","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"anjeunna"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"ngeunaan"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"sadaya"},{"surface":"הרעה","gloss":"kagoréan"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"nu"},{"surface":"הביא","gloss":"ditimbulkeun"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahwe"},{"surface":"עליו","gloss":"ka anjeunna"},{"surface":"ויתנו","gloss":"méré"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"ka anjeunna"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"unggal jalma"},{"surface":"קשיטה","gloss":"késita (keurakan pérak)"},{"surface":"אחת","gloss":"hiji"},{"surface":"ואיש","gloss":"sarta unggal jalma"},{"surface":"נזם","gloss":"anting irung"},{"surface":"זהב","gloss":"tina emas"},{"surface":"אחד","gloss":"hiji"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-26T15:23:59.019288508Z","model":"glm-5.3"}